ure how far along the anime has gotten, but umm it gets very far away from that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-22T02:08:11-07:00","id":1398141,"title":"","content":"dunno I watched around Episode 20-25 of Season 1 where one guy took a stone (hearthstone?) from one out of the five hearthstone slots in his back and started talking into it and his voice was like a megaphone to all the people in the village","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25272-cypheriel","name":"Cypheriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T17:50:18-07:00","id":1509424,"title":"","content":"During lockdown I rediscovered the Skyrim total conversion mod Enderal: Shards of Order which had been expanded into Enderal: Forgotten Stories. While it's not first on the list of things I'd point people to for Exalted inspiration* there's some solid world building and storytelling that's helped me realise what I want from my fantasy settings and how I want them to make me feel. It's very true to Ex3's approach to lore where everything is subjective and sometimes leaves you with a mystery. I'd go into more detail but Enderal is really something I believe you're poorer for not having played and am generally loathed to spoil. <br /> <br /> *It's hardly absentthough, the game deals with the recent loss of a group of sorcerous godkings called the Lightborn who were not exactly beloved towards the end of their reign but the power vacuum created by their absence has created a situation that threatens the world's future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 04-23-2023, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}